# Methodology of Digital Transformation Risk Assessment for the Enterprises of the Electronics and Electrical Engineering

**Authors:** N. I. Zaozerskaya, M. Kossukhina, Vlada I. Gorelikova

## Abstract
nowadays, one of the enterprises in the electronics and electrical engineering industry digital transformation problems is the issues related to the assessment of the digital maturity of the enterprise business processes. The paper examines the relationship between the concepts of digital maturity of business processes and digital transformation. The authors have developed a model for assessing the risks of digital transformation of an enterprise based on a model for assessing digital maturity, taking into account the digitalization of the data level, application level, technological level, as well as the business level of the corporate architecture according to the TOGAF methodology.

